---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Submit Cerita"
description: "Kirim cerita horror, riddle, urban legend, atau pengalaman aneh lo ke BARU NGEH."
---
<section class="section"><div class="container submit-wrap"><div class="submit-copy"><div class="eyebrow">Dari komunitas</div><h2>Punya cerita yang bikin orang <span class="text-red">baru ngeh?</span></h2><p>Kirim horror story, riddle, urban legend, atau pengalaman aneh. Tim BARU NGEH akan review sebelum tayang. Nama boleh disamarkan.</p><p style="font-size:12px;color:#5f5c58">Cerita yang masuk kami baca dan seleksi dulu sebelum dipublikasikan.</p></div>
<form name="submit-cerita" method="POST" data-netlify="true" data-netlify-honeypot="bot-field" action="/terima-kasih/" class="form">
  <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="submit-cerita">
  <p hidden><label>Kosongkan kolom ini: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>
  <div class="field"><label>Judul</label><input name="title" required placeholder="Contoh: Telepon Jam 3 Pagi"></div>
  <div class="field"><label>Kategori</label><select name="category"><option>Horror Riddle</option><option>Mystery</option><option>Psychological</option><option>Urban Legend</option><option>Detective</option><option>Paranormal</option></select></div>
  <div class="field"><label>Cerita</label><textarea name="story" required placeholder="Tulis cerita lo di sini..."></textarea></div>
  <div class="field"><label>Nama / alias</label><input name="author" placeholder="Opsional"></div>
  <div class="field"><label>Email (opsional, kalau mau dihubungi)</label><input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Opsional"></div>
  <button class="btn primary" type="submit">Kirim ke BARU NGEH</button>
</form>
</div></section>
